        "Content": "<ul><li>Attractive detached family home built c.1936</li><li>Generous private and mature gardens of 0.454 acres/0.1838 ha approx.</li><li>Set well back from the road with large gravelled parking area to the front</li><li>Flexible and versatile layout with 5 bedrooms (two ensuite)</li><li>Separate unit with kitchenette and shower area</li><li>Large sunroom with stunning views of the mature garden</li><li>Enclosed car port</li><li>Cedar cabin with infra-red sauna and 6 seater jacuzzi</li><li>Gas fired central heating</ul>"
